<h2>Where should the filters go?</h2>
<p class="subtitle">Same controls in each: two shortcuts (Failed sign-ins, Security changes), an Event type select, and a From / To date range with a "This week / Last week" preset. Wireframes only, not final styling.</p>

<div class="options">
  <div class="option" data-choice="a" onclick="toggleSelect(this)">
    <div class="letter">A</div>
    <div class="content">
      <h3>Filter bar above the table</h3>
      <p>Always visible between the intro and the table. Nothing hidden; costs vertical space; wraps to stacked fields at 320px.</p>
      <div class="mockup">
        <div class="mockup-header">Account activity</div>
        <div class="mockup-body">
          <p style="margin:0 0 8px">Every sign-in and account change from the last 90 days, newest first.</p>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:flex-end;padding:12px;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:8px">
            <button class="mock-button">Failed sign-ins</button>
            <button class="mock-button">Security changes</button>
            <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px">Event type<input class="mock-input" placeholder="All events"></label>
            <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px">Dates<input class="mock-input" placeholder="Last week ▾"></label>
            <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px">From<input class="mock-input" placeholder="Sep 21, 2026"></label>
            <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px">To<input class="mock-input" placeholder="Sep 27, 2026"></label>
          </div>
          <p style="margin:0 0 8px">Showing 6 of 48 events</p>
          <div class="placeholder">Table: When | Event | Device | Location | IP | Details</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="option" data-choice="b" onclick="toggleSelect(this)">
    <div class="letter">B</div>
    <div class="content">
      <h3>Shortcuts inline, rest in a "Filters" popover</h3>
      <p>The two common cases are one click; type and dates sit behind a button and show as removable tags when active. Compact, but the date range is one click further away.</p>
      <div class="mockup">
        <div class="mockup-header">Account activity</div>
        <div class="mockup-body">
          <p style="margin:0 0 8px">Every sign-in and account change from the last 90 days, newest first.</p>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;margin-bottom:8px">
            <button class="mock-button">Failed sign-ins</button>
            <button class="mock-button">Security changes</button>
            <button class="mock-button">Filters ▾</button>
            <span style="padding:2px 8px;border:1px solid #888;border-radius:12px">Sep 21 – Sep 27 ✕</span>
          </div>
          <div style="width:280px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:6px;margin-bottom:8px">
            <div class="label">Popover (open)</div>
            <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;margin-bottom:8px">Event type<input class="mock-input" placeholder="All events"></label>
            <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;margin-bottom:8px">Dates<input class="mock-input" placeholder="Last week ▾"></label>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:8px"><input class="mock-input" placeholder="From"><input class="mock-input" placeholder="To"></div>
          </div>
          <p style="margin:0 0 8px">Showing 6 of 48 events</p>
          <div class="placeholder">Table: When | Event | Device | Location | IP | Details</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="option" data-choice="c" onclick="toggleSelect(this)">
    <div class="letter">C</div>
    <div class="content">
      <h3>Sidebar to the left of the table</h3>
      <p>Filters stay in view while scrolling. Takes width from a six-column table that is already wide; must collapse above the table on narrow screens.</p>
      <div class="mockup">
        <div class="mockup-header">Account activity</div>
        <div class="mockup-body">
          <p style="margin:0 0 8px">Every sign-in and account change from the last 90 days, newest first.</p>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:12px">
            <div style="width:180px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px;padding:12px;border:1px solid #ccc;border-radius:6px">
              <button class="mock-button">Failed sign-ins</button>
              <button class="mock-button">Security changes</button>
              <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px">Event type<input class="mock-input" placeholder="All events"></label>
              <label style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px">Dates<input class="mock-input" placeholder="Last week ▾"></label>
              <input class="mock-input" placeholder="From">
              <input class="mock-input" placeholder="To">
            </div>
            <div style="flex:1">
              <p style="margin:0 0 8px">Showing 6 of 48 events</p>
              <div class="placeholder" style="min-height:200px">Table: When | Event | Device | Location | IP | Details</div>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
